@startsalt wf-approve-access
' Low-fi wireframe — SCR-CONSENT-ACCESS (web consent screen), fed by RM-CONSENT-APPROVAL.
' PROPOSAL, AI; iteration 4: reached after the IDP login screen; the approval is then confirmed on
' the SCA screen in the bank app (SRC-ADR).
' Every field maps to a read-model field; the copy is placeholder, not UX-approved (gate G1).
' Data: spec example consent (SRC-IG §6.3.1.1); "Sandbox AISP Ltd" is a placeholder (A-09).
title SCR-CONSENT-ACCESS — consent screen, low-fi wireframe (proposal)
{+
  {* <b>⟨Bank⟩ · Consent</b> | "(bank identity always visible — UX-03, Q-47)" }
  ..
  <b>Allow access to your accounts?</b>
  ..
  <b>Sandbox AISP Ltd</b>
  "Licensed account information provider"
  ..
  <b>Wants to see</b>
  {#
    Account | Access
    "Current account · DE40 …8608 · EUR" | "Balances, transactions"
  }
  ..
  <b>For how long</b>
  "Until 1 November 2017 (set by your bank)"
  "Up to 4 times a day without you"
  ..
  "Your bank does not share your login details with Sandbox AISP Ltd."
  ..
  { [  Decline  ] | [  Allow  ] }
  "After 'Allow' you confirm on the SCA screen in your bank app."
  ..
  "Request expires in ⟨SCA window — Q-29⟩"
}
@endsalt
